# 手写语料：48 段中文技术短文 + 对应英文版；40 条查询，每条标注 1 个相关段落。
DOCS = [
 # id, zh, en
 ("k8s-liveness", "存活探针连续失败达到阈值后，kubelet 会杀掉容器并按重启策略重新拉起。探针检查的依赖如果是数据库，数据库一抖，所有 Pod 会一起重启。",
  "When a liveness probe fails past its threshold, the kubelet kills the container and restarts it according to the restart policy. If the probe checks a database dependency, a database hiccup restarts every pod at once."),
 ("k8s-readiness", "就绪探针失败不会重启容器，只会把 Pod 从 Service 的端点列表里摘掉，流量不再转发给它，恢复后再加回来。",
  "A failing readiness probe does not restart the container. It only removes the pod from the Service endpoints so it stops receiving traffic, and adds it back once it recovers."),
 ("k8s-startup", "启动探针成功之前，存活探针和就绪探针都不会执行。启动慢的 Java 服务用它可以避免还没起来就被存活探针杀掉。",
  "Until the startup probe succeeds, liveness and readiness probes are not run. Slow-starting Java services use it to avoid being killed by the liveness probe before they finish booting."),
 ("k8s-cpu-limit", "CPU limit 通过 CFS 配额实现，每 100 毫秒的周期内用完配额就会被节流，即使节点上还有空闲 CPU，延迟也会出现尖刺。",
  "A CPU limit is enforced with CFS quota. Once a container uses its quota within each 100 ms period it is throttled, even if the node has idle CPU, which shows up as latency spikes."),
 ("k8s-oomkilled", "容器内存超过 limit 时，内核的 cgroup OOM 会杀掉进程，Pod 状态显示 OOMKilled，退出码是 137。内存 request 只影响调度，不会触发这个。",
  "When a container exceeds its memory limit, the kernel cgroup OOM killer terminates the process. The pod shows OOMKilled with exit code 137. The memory request only affects scheduling and never triggers this."),
 ("k8s-pdb", "PodDisruptionBudget 限制自愿驱逐时最多能同时不可用的 Pod 数量，节点排空时会等待，直到满足预算才继续驱逐下一个。",
  "A PodDisruptionBudget limits how many pods can be unavailable at once during voluntary evictions. When draining a node, eviction waits until the budget allows the next pod to go."),
 ("k8s-hpa", "HPA 根据 CPU 使用率相对 request 的百分比计算副本数，如果 Pod 没有设置 CPU request，HPA 无法计算，会一直显示 unknown。",
  "The HPA computes replica counts from CPU usage as a percentage of the request. If pods have no CPU request, the HPA cannot compute it and keeps showing unknown."),
 ("k8s-configmap-env", "以环境变量方式注入的 ConfigMap 修改后不会自动生效，进程启动时读取一次就固定了，需要重建 Pod；以卷挂载的文件会在一段延迟后更新。",
  "A ConfigMap injected as environment variables does not take effect after you edit it, because the process reads it once at startup; the pod must be recreated. Files mounted from a volume are updated after a delay."),
 ("go-memlimit", "GOMEMLIMIT 给 Go 运行时设置软内存上限，堆接近上限时 GC 会更频繁地运行。它不是硬限制，存活对象超过上限时进程仍然会继续分配。",
  "GOMEMLIMIT sets a soft memory limit for the Go runtime, making the GC run more often as the heap approaches it. It is not a hard cap: if live objects exceed it, the process keeps allocating."),
 ("go-gogc", "GOGC 默认是 100，表示堆增长到上次 GC 后存活堆的两倍时触发下一次回收。调大它会减少 GC 次数，但峰值内存更高。",
  "GOGC defaults to 100, meaning the next collection starts when the heap grows to twice the live heap after the previous GC. Raising it reduces GC frequency at the cost of higher peak memory."),
 ("go-goroutine-leak", "向无缓冲 channel 发送数据时，如果没有接收方，发送的 goroutine 会永远阻塞。请求超时返回后留下的这种 goroutine 会越积越多。",
  "Sending on an unbuffered channel blocks forever if nobody receives. Goroutines left behind like this after a request times out keep piling up."),
 ("go-context", "context 被取消后，Done 通道会关闭，下游函数应该检查它并尽快返回。只传 context 而不检查，取消信号就不会起任何作用。",
  "When a context is cancelled its Done channel is closed, and downstream functions should check it and return promptly. Passing a context around without checking it means cancellation does nothing."),
 ("go-defer-loop", "在循环里写 defer 关闭文件，文件要等整个函数返回时才会关闭，循环次数多时会耗尽文件描述符。应该把循环体抽成函数。",
  "Deferring a file close inside a loop only closes the files when the whole function returns, which can exhaust file descriptors in a long loop. Move the loop body into its own function."),
 ("go-map-race", "多个 goroutine 同时写同一个 map，运行时会直接抛出 fatal error: concurrent map writes，这个错误无法用 recover 捕获。",
  "When several goroutines write the same map concurrently, the runtime aborts with fatal error: concurrent map writes, and this cannot be caught with recover."),
 ("go-slice-append", "两个切片共享同一个底层数组时，对其中一个 append 可能覆盖另一个切片能看到的元素，容量还有余量时尤其容易发生。",
  "When two slices share one backing array, appending to one of them can overwrite elements visible through the other, especially when spare capacity remains."),
 ("go-http-timeout", "http.DefaultClient 没有设置超时，对方不响应时请求会一直挂着。生产代码应该自己创建 Client 并设置 Timeout。",
  "http.DefaultClient has no timeout, so a request hangs forever if the server never responds. Production code should build its own Client with a Timeout."),
 ("linux-oom-score", "系统内存耗尽时，内核 OOM killer 按 oom_score 选择要杀的进程，可以通过 oom_score_adj 调低关键进程被选中的概率。",
  "When the system runs out of memory, the kernel OOM killer picks a victim by oom_score. Lowering oom_score_adj makes a critical process less likely to be chosen."),
 ("linux-loadavg", "Linux 的负载平均值统计的是可运行和不可中断睡眠状态的进程数，磁盘 IO 卡住时 CPU 很空，负载也会很高。",
  "Linux load average counts processes that are runnable or in uninterruptible sleep, so when disk IO stalls the load can be high even though the CPU is idle."),
 ("linux-inode", "磁盘空间还有剩余却提示 No space left on device，可能是 inode 用完了，用 df -i 查看，常见原因是大量小文件。",
  "Getting No space left on device while the disk still has free space can mean the inodes are exhausted. Check with df -i; a huge number of small files is the usual cause."),
 ("linux-ulimit", "进程能打开的文件描述符数量受 ulimit -n 限制，超过后报 too many open files。systemd 服务要在 unit 里用 LimitNOFILE 设置。",
  "The number of file descriptors a process can open is capped by ulimit -n, and exceeding it gives too many open files. For systemd services set LimitNOFILE in the unit."),
 ("linux-swappiness", "vm.swappiness 控制内核回收内存时倾向换出匿名页还是丢弃页缓存，数值越小越少使用交换分区。",
  "vm.swappiness controls whether the kernel prefers swapping out anonymous pages or dropping page cache when reclaiming memory; lower values use swap less."),
 ("linux-systemd-restart", "systemd 的 Restart=on-failure 只在非零退出或被信号杀死时重启服务，配合 StartLimitBurst 可以防止无限重启循环。",
  "systemd Restart=on-failure restarts a service only on a non-zero exit or a fatal signal, and StartLimitBurst prevents an endless restart loop."),
 ("linux-journal-vacuum", "journald 日志可能占用几个 GB 的磁盘，用 journalctl --vacuum-size 清理，或在 journald.conf 里设置 SystemMaxUse 限制总量。",
  "journald logs can take several gigabytes of disk. Clean them with journalctl --vacuum-size, or cap the total with SystemMaxUse in journald.conf."),
 ("linux-time-wait", "主动关闭连接的一方会进入 TIME_WAIT 状态并保持约 60 秒，高频短连接的客户端可能因此耗尽本地端口。",
  "The side that actively closes a connection enters TIME_WAIT for about 60 seconds, so clients making many short connections can run out of local ports."),
 ("docker-layer-cache", "Dockerfile 中某一层变化后，后面所有层的缓存都会失效。先复制依赖清单安装依赖，再复制源码，可以让改代码时不重装依赖。",
  "When one layer in a Dockerfile changes, the cache for every later layer is invalidated. Copy the dependency manifest and install dependencies before copying the source so code edits do not reinstall them."),
 ("docker-multistage", "多阶段构建在一个阶段里编译，只把产物复制到精简的运行镜像中，最终镜像不包含编译器和源码，体积小很多。",
  "A multi-stage build compiles in one stage and copies only the artifacts into a slim runtime image, so the final image carries no compiler or source and is much smaller."),
 ("docker-ignore", ".dockerignore 决定哪些文件不会发送到构建上下文，漏掉 node_modules 或 .git 会让每次构建都上传几百 MB。",
  ".dockerignore decides which files are left out of the build context. Forgetting node_modules or .git means every build uploads hundreds of megabytes."),
 ("docker-pid1", "容器里的进程是 PID 1 时，默认不会响应 SIGTERM，docker stop 要等 10 秒超时后用 SIGKILL 杀掉。用 exec 形式的 ENTRYPOINT 或加 init 进程可以解决。",
  "When the process in a container is PID 1 it ignores SIGTERM by default, so docker stop waits for a 10 second timeout and then sends SIGKILL. Use the exec form of ENTRYPOINT or add an init process."),
 ("docker-volume", "命名卷由 Docker 管理，数据在容器删除后保留；绑定挂载直接映射宿主机路径，权限和 UID 不一致时容器内会写不进去。",
  "Named volumes are managed by Docker and keep data after the container is removed. Bind mounts map a host path directly, and mismatched permissions or UIDs can make it unwritable inside the container."),
 ("docker-latest-tag", "latest 标签只是一个可以被覆盖的名字，不代表最新版本。部署时用固定版本号或镜像摘要，回滚才能拿到同一个镜像。",
  "The latest tag is just a name that can be overwritten, not a guarantee of the newest version. Deploy with a fixed version or an image digest so a rollback gets the same image."),
 ("net-dns-ttl", "修改 DNS 记录后，旧记录会在各级缓存里保留到 TTL 过期，所以迁移前应该先把 TTL 调小，等旧 TTL 过去再切换。",
  "After a DNS record changes, the old answer stays in caches until its TTL expires. Lower the TTL ahead of a migration and wait out the old TTL before switching."),
 ("net-keepalive", "TCP keepalive 是内核在空闲连接上发送探测包，检测对端是否还活着；HTTP keep-alive 是在同一个连接上复用多个请求，两者不是一回事。",
  "TCP keepalive is the kernel sending probes on an idle connection to see if the peer is alive; HTTP keep-alive reuses one connection for several requests. They are different things."),
 ("net-mtu", "隧道或 VPN 会增加包头，有效 MTU 变小。如果路径上丢弃了 ICMP 分片提示，大包会静默丢失，表现为小请求正常、大响应卡住。",
  "Tunnels and VPNs add headers and shrink the effective MTU. If ICMP fragmentation-needed messages are dropped along the path, large packets vanish silently: small requests work while large responses hang."),
 ("net-sni", "TLS 握手时客户端通过 SNI 告诉服务器要访问的域名，同一个 IP 上的多个 HTTPS 站点靠它选择证书。",
  "During the TLS handshake the client sends the hostname through SNI, which lets one IP serve several HTTPS sites and pick the right certificate."),
 ("net-http2-hol", "HTTP/2 在一个 TCP 连接上多路复用，应用层没有队头阻塞，但丢一个 TCP 包仍会让所有流一起等待重传。",
  "HTTP/2 multiplexes streams over one TCP connection, removing application-level head-of-line blocking, but a single lost TCP packet still makes every stream wait for the retransmission."),
 ("net-cdn-purge", "CDN 缓存了 HTML 后，源站更新内容也不会立刻生效，需要按 URL 或全部清除缓存，或者在发布流程里自动触发清除。",
  "Once a CDN caches HTML, updates at the origin do not show up immediately. Purge the cache by URL or entirely, or trigger the purge automatically in the release pipeline."),
 ("git-rebase", "rebase 把当前分支的提交在新基点上重放，历史是一条直线；merge 保留分支结构并生成合并提交。已推送的公共分支不要 rebase。",
  "Rebase replays the branch's commits onto a new base for a linear history, while merge keeps the branch structure with a merge commit. Do not rebase a public branch that others have pulled."),
 ("git-reflog", "误用 reset --hard 丢掉的提交并没有立刻消失，git reflog 记录了 HEAD 的每次移动，找到提交号后可以恢复。",
  "Commits lost to an accidental reset --hard are not gone right away. git reflog records every move of HEAD, so you can find the commit hash and restore it."),
 ("git-force-lease", "git push --force-with-lease 只有在远程分支仍是你上次看到的位置时才会覆盖，可以避免冲掉别人刚推上去的提交。",
  "git push --force-with-lease only overwrites the remote branch if it is still where you last saw it, which avoids wiping out commits someone else just pushed."),
 ("git-bisect", "git bisect 在一个好提交和一个坏提交之间二分查找，每次标记 good 或 bad，几步就能定位引入问题的那次提交。",
  "git bisect binary-searches between a good and a bad commit; marking each step good or bad finds the commit that introduced the problem in a few steps."),
 ("db-leftmost", "联合索引遵循最左前缀原则，索引是 (a, b, c) 时，只按 b 和 c 过滤的查询用不上这个索引。",
  "A composite index follows the leftmost prefix rule: with an index on (a, b, c), a query filtering only on b and c cannot use it."),
 ("db-isolation", "MySQL InnoDB 默认隔离级别是可重复读，同一事务里多次读取结果一致，通过间隙锁减少幻读。",
  "MySQL InnoDB defaults to repeatable read: repeated reads inside one transaction return the same result, and gap locks reduce phantom reads."),
 ("db-pool", "连接池耗尽时新请求会排队等待连接，表现为接口超时而数据库本身并不忙，常见原因是事务没有及时提交或连接没有归还。",
  "When the connection pool is exhausted, new requests queue for a connection, showing up as API timeouts while the database itself is idle. Uncommitted transactions or connections never returned are the usual causes."),
 ("db-slowlog", "开启慢查询日志并设置 long_query_time，可以记录执行时间超过阈值的 SQL，再用 EXPLAIN 查看是否走了索引。",
  "Enable the slow query log and set long_query_time to record statements slower than the threshold, then use EXPLAIN to see whether they use an index."),
 ("llm-ctx-trunc", "提示词超过模型的上下文窗口时，推理服务可能静默截断输入，模型看不到被截掉的部分，回答会文不对题。",
  "When a prompt exceeds the model's context window, the inference server may silently truncate it; the model never sees the cut part and answers off topic."),
 ("llm-temperature", "温度越高，采样时低概率的词越容易被选中，输出越发散；温度为 0 时每次都选概率最高的词。",
  "A higher temperature makes low-probability tokens more likely to be sampled and the output more varied; at temperature 0 the most likely token is always chosen."),
 ("llm-cosine", "向量检索通常用余弦相似度比较查询向量和文档向量，向量归一化后余弦相似度等于点积。",
  "Vector search usually compares query and document vectors with cosine similarity; after normalization, cosine similarity equals the dot product."),
 ("llm-chunk", "RAG 切分文档时，块太大会稀释与问题相关的信息，块太小又会丢掉上下文，常见做法是几百个 token 一块并带一些重叠。",
  "When chunking documents for RAG, chunks that are too large dilute the relevant information and chunks that are too small lose context; a few hundred tokens with some overlap is common."),
]

QUERIES = [
 # (relevant doc id, zh query, en query)
 ("k8s-liveness", "为什么数据库抖一下，所有 Pod 都被重启了？", "Why did every pod restart when the database had a brief hiccup?"),
 ("k8s-readiness", "Pod 没重启但就是收不到流量，可能是哪个探针在起作用？", "The pod is not restarting but gets no traffic. Which probe is likely responsible?"),
 ("k8s-startup", "启动很慢的服务总是还没起来就被杀，怎么办？", "A slow-booting service keeps getting killed before it is up. What should I use?"),
 ("k8s-cpu-limit", "节点 CPU 明明很空，容器延迟却有尖刺，是什么原因？", "The node has spare CPU but my container shows latency spikes. Why?"),
 ("k8s-oomkilled", "容器退出码 137 是什么意思？", "What does container exit code 137 mean?"),
 ("k8s-pdb", "排空节点时卡住不动，一直在等什么？", "Draining a node hangs. What is it waiting for?"),
 ("k8s-hpa", "自动扩缩容的指标一直显示 unknown，怎么回事？", "The autoscaler metric always shows unknown. What is wrong?"),
 ("k8s-configmap-env", "改了配置，容器里的环境变量为什么还是旧的？", "I changed the config but the environment variable in the container is still old. Why?"),
 ("go-memlimit", "Go 程序的软内存上限怎么设置，超过了会怎样？", "How do I set a soft memory limit for a Go program, and what happens when it is exceeded?"),
 ("go-gogc", "想让 Go 少做几次垃圾回收，该调哪个参数？", "Which setting makes Go garbage collect less often?"),
 ("go-goroutine-leak", "请求超时以后 goroutine 数量一直涨，可能是什么问题？", "After requests time out the goroutine count keeps climbing. What could cause it?"),
 ("go-context", "传了 context 但取消没有效果，为什么？", "I pass a context but cancelling it has no effect. Why?"),
 ("go-defer-loop", "循环里打开很多文件，最后报文件描述符不够，代码哪里写错了？", "Opening many files in a loop ends with too many file descriptors. What is wrong in the code?"),
 ("go-map-race", "程序崩溃提示并发写 map，能不能用 recover 兜住？", "The program crashes with a concurrent map write. Can recover catch it?"),
 ("go-http-timeout", "Go 发 HTTP 请求一直卡着不返回，默认客户端有超时吗？", "A Go HTTP request hangs and never returns. Does the default client have a timeout?"),
 ("linux-oom-score", "内存不够时怎么保护关键进程不被内核杀掉？", "How do I protect a critical process from being killed by the kernel when memory runs out?"),
 ("linux-loadavg", "CPU 使用率很低，负载却很高，正常吗？", "CPU usage is low but the load is very high. Is that normal?"),
 ("linux-inode", "磁盘还有空间却说写不进去，怎么排查？", "The disk has free space but writes fail with no space left. How do I check?"),
 ("linux-ulimit", "服务报 too many open files，systemd 里怎么调大限制？", "My service reports too many open files. How do I raise the limit under systemd?"),
 ("linux-systemd-restart", "怎么让服务崩溃后自动重启，又不会无限重启？", "How do I make a service restart after crashing without looping forever?"),
 ("linux-journal-vacuum", "系统日志把磁盘占满了，怎么清理和限制？", "System logs filled the disk. How do I clean and cap them?"),
 ("linux-time-wait", "客户端大量短连接后本地端口不够用了，原因是什么？", "A client making many short connections runs out of local ports. What is the cause?"),
 ("docker-layer-cache", "每次改一行代码，镜像构建都要重新安装依赖，怎么优化？", "Every one-line code change makes the image build reinstall dependencies. How do I fix that?"),
 ("docker-multistage", "怎么让最终镜像里不带编译器，体积更小？", "How do I keep the compiler out of the final image and make it smaller?"),
 ("docker-pid1", "docker stop 总要等十秒才停下来，为什么？", "docker stop always takes ten seconds to stop the container. Why?"),
 ("docker-volume", "挂载宿主机目录后容器里写不进文件，是什么原因？", "After mounting a host directory the container cannot write files. Why?"),
 ("docker-latest-tag", "回滚时拉到的镜像和之前的不一样，标签有什么问题？", "A rollback pulled a different image than before. What is wrong with the tag?"),
 ("net-dns-ttl", "改了域名解析，为什么有些用户还在访问旧地址？", "I changed the DNS record. Why are some users still reaching the old address?"),
 ("net-keepalive", "TCP 的保活和 HTTP 的长连接是一回事吗？", "Is TCP keepalive the same thing as HTTP keep-alive?"),
 ("net-mtu", "走 VPN 以后小请求正常，大响应就卡住，可能是什么问题？", "Over a VPN small requests work but large responses hang. What could it be?"),
 ("net-sni", "一个 IP 上跑多个 HTTPS 网站，服务器怎么知道用哪个证书？", "With several HTTPS sites on one IP, how does the server know which certificate to use?"),
 ("net-cdn-purge", "网站发布了新版本，用户看到的还是旧页面，怎么办？", "I deployed a new version of the site but users still see the old page. What do I do?"),
 ("git-reflog", "不小心 reset --hard 了，提交还能找回来吗？", "I accidentally ran reset --hard. Can I get the commits back?"),
 ("git-force-lease", "强制推送时怎么避免覆盖同事刚推的提交？", "How do I force push without overwriting a teammate's latest commits?"),
 ("git-bisect", "不知道哪次提交引入了 bug，有没有快速定位的方法？", "I do not know which commit introduced a bug. Is there a quick way to find it?"),
 ("db-leftmost", "建了联合索引，为什么这个查询没用上？", "I created a composite index. Why does this query not use it?"),
 ("db-pool", "接口大量超时，但数据库负载很低，可能是哪里的问题？", "Many API calls time out while the database load is low. Where is the problem likely?"),
 ("llm-ctx-trunc", "给模型塞了很长的资料，回答却文不对题，可能是什么原因？", "I gave the model a long document and the answer is off topic. What might be happening?"),
 ("llm-temperature", "想让模型每次输出都一样，采样参数怎么设？", "How should I set sampling so the model gives the same output every time?"),
 ("llm-chunk", "做知识库检索时，文档切多大一块比较合适？", "When building retrieval over a knowledge base, how big should each document chunk be?"),
]
assert len(DOCS) == 48 and len(QUERIES) == 40
ids = {d[0] for d in DOCS}
assert all(q[0] in ids for q in QUERIES) and len({q[0] for q in QUERIES}) == 40
